{"1810630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lokko", "steam_appid": 1810630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/2e9f7b38d803cf1ac7affc5116d048ff.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/2e9f7b38d803cf1ac7affc5116d048ff.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/2e9f7b38d803cf1ac7affc5116d048ff.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Lokko is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>. Some features are limited or still in development and may not work as expected. Player inventories, content, and unlocks may reset when the game exits Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're building Lokko alongside our community, and your feedback shapes every update. To submit in-game feedback, press <strong>L3+R3 </strong>on DualSense™ or Gamepad, <strong>F8</strong> on keyboard, or <strong>L3+R3</strong> on Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@appymonkeys.com\">support@appymonkeys.com</a>  </strong><br><strong>Discord: <u></u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Lokko</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOKKO is a unique 3D platformer where fun meets creativity. Create and share challenging levels across PS5®, PC and iOS seamlessly and in real time. Create your own avatar and design your own enemies and bosses. Trade your creations, challenge other players, and compete to make the most creative level out there. Full DualSense™ support across every platform. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3D Level Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/99d88df71bf46ec81898d71d6cccf129.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/99d88df71bf46ec81898d71d6cccf129.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/99d88df71bf46ec81898d71d6cccf129.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and share your own 3D platforming levels with our intuitive in-game editor. Connect timers, accelerators, and switches, drop in enemies and bosses, and design challenges to share with friends. Full controller and keyboard/mouse support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2D Level Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ba214bb83ba264fc699239b381c5fb91.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ba214bb83ba264fc699239b381c5fb91.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ba214bb83ba264fc699239b381c5fb91.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Create challenging 2D levels fast. Place platforms to leap across, enemies to dash through, and obstacles to dodge — then play-test in real time as you build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Car Track Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/688d1305442a2c921fe94806b0289ad7.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/688d1305442a2c921fe94806b0289ad7.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/688d1305442a2c921fe94806b0289ad7.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/98af1b181f8d5c4d0fe8eab53e994e17.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/98af1b181f8d5c4d0fe8eab53e994e17.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/98af1b181f8d5c4d0fe8eab53e994e17.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create exciting tracks to drive on. Customize your car with wheels, engines and spoilers in our Car Workshop. Paint and add to your car chassis to get your coolest looking car.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avatar Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/761132549d6f9caba8684fc87533147f.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/761132549d6f9caba8684fc87533147f.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/761132549d6f9caba8684fc87533147f.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character endlessly. Add, delete, and paint blocks to create the look you want, then push your avatar straight into all our gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemy Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3158c1440f6f5e851a235f058bc7929f.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3158c1440f6f5e851a235f058bc7929f.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3158c1440f6f5e851a235f058bc7929f.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reshape the look and behavior of every NPC enemy. Build, paint, and tweak — then drop your creations into the Level Editor instantly to see them in action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LABS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ff9aa20a4cf898f55772056439637de2.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ff9aa20a4cf898f55772056439637de2.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ff9aa20a4cf898f55772056439637de2.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playground for our upcoming, experimental game modes. Try them early and let us know what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko enables users of all ages to collaborate, create and play using Steam Deck™.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko enables users of all ages to collaborate, create and play using DualSense™ Wireless Controller, Xbox Wireless Controller &amp; Mouse and Keyboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE PVP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3f5cee38c832ade3d66b0478109e69ef.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3f5cee38c832ade3d66b0478109e69ef.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3f5cee38c832ade3d66b0478109e69ef.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends, anywhere! Try out the Online PvP game mode and race to the finish line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOCAL PVP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/d5b9cc2c9a04f49d97ed6ffc7cec1144.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/d5b9cc2c9a04f49d97ed6ffc7cec1144.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/d5b9cc2c9a04f49d97ed6ffc7cec1144.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends to a fun, platforming race in our local splitscreen PvP Mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/f70378096b2300e29afa88425d3b9cba.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/f70378096b2300e29afa88425d3b9cba.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/f70378096b2300e29afa88425d3b9cba.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lokko Pizza</strong> is the best pizza joint in the world — and they hand-deliver smoking-hot pizzas anywhere on the globe. Run by Lokko and his brother, Chef Lokko, the shop has built its name on fresh dough, real ingredients, and an impossible promise: from a sweet Hawaiian Surprise to a cheesy Sicilian Special, your pizza arrives hot, fast, and right to your door — no matter where in the world you may be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But across town - <strong>Goobol</strong>, the CEO of a soulless fast-food empire, has built his fortune on cheap, frozen, factory-pressed pizza — and he can't stand competition. With an army of minions at his command, Goobol will do anything to shut Lokko down and force the world to eat his terrible pizzas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko isn't backing down. He'll run, drive, and even teleport through space and time to get a fresh, wholesome pizza into the hands of every hungry customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world deserves a better slice. Help Lokko deliver it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAM DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/51e8f5474f468c5b1c74aa504a49da6d.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/51e8f5474f468c5b1c74aa504a49da6d.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/51e8f5474f468c5b1c74aa504a49da6d.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lokko enables users of all ages to collaborate, create and play using Steam Deck™.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko enables users of all ages to collaborate, create and play using DualSense™ Wireless Controller, Xbox Wireless Controller &amp; Mouse and Keyboard.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/2e9f7b38d803cf1ac7affc5116d048ff.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/2e9f7b38d803cf1ac7affc5116d048ff.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/2e9f7b38d803cf1ac7affc5116d048ff.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Lokko is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>. Some features are limited or still in development and may not work as expected. Player inventories, content, and unlocks may reset when the game exits Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're building Lokko alongside our community, and your feedback shapes every update. To submit in-game feedback, press <strong>L3+R3 </strong>on DualSense™ or Gamepad, <strong>F8</strong> on keyboard, or <strong>L3+R3</strong> on Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@appymonkeys.com\">support@appymonkeys.com</a>  </strong><br><strong>Discord: <u></u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Lokko</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOKKO is a unique 3D platformer where fun meets creativity. Create and share challenging levels across PS5®, PC and iOS seamlessly and in real time. Create your own avatar and design your own enemies and bosses. Trade your creations, challenge other players, and compete to make the most creative level out there. Full DualSense™ support across every platform. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3D Level Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/99d88df71bf46ec81898d71d6cccf129.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/99d88df71bf46ec81898d71d6cccf129.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/99d88df71bf46ec81898d71d6cccf129.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and share your own 3D platforming levels with our intuitive in-game editor. Connect timers, accelerators, and switches, drop in enemies and bosses, and design challenges to share with friends. Full controller and keyboard/mouse support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2D Level Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ba214bb83ba264fc699239b381c5fb91.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ba214bb83ba264fc699239b381c5fb91.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ba214bb83ba264fc699239b381c5fb91.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Create challenging 2D levels fast. Place platforms to leap across, enemies to dash through, and obstacles to dodge — then play-test in real time as you build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Car Track Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/688d1305442a2c921fe94806b0289ad7.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/688d1305442a2c921fe94806b0289ad7.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/688d1305442a2c921fe94806b0289ad7.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/98af1b181f8d5c4d0fe8eab53e994e17.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/98af1b181f8d5c4d0fe8eab53e994e17.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/98af1b181f8d5c4d0fe8eab53e994e17.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create exciting tracks to drive on. Customize your car with wheels, engines and spoilers in our Car Workshop. Paint and add to your car chassis to get your coolest looking car.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avatar Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/761132549d6f9caba8684fc87533147f.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/761132549d6f9caba8684fc87533147f.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/761132549d6f9caba8684fc87533147f.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character endlessly. Add, delete, and paint blocks to create the look you want, then push your avatar straight into all our gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemy Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3158c1440f6f5e851a235f058bc7929f.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3158c1440f6f5e851a235f058bc7929f.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3158c1440f6f5e851a235f058bc7929f.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reshape the look and behavior of every NPC enemy. Build, paint, and tweak — then drop your creations into the Level Editor instantly to see them in action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LABS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ff9aa20a4cf898f55772056439637de2.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ff9aa20a4cf898f55772056439637de2.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/ff9aa20a4cf898f55772056439637de2.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playground for our upcoming, experimental game modes. Try them early and let us know what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko enables users of all ages to collaborate, create and play using Steam Deck™.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko enables users of all ages to collaborate, create and play using DualSense™ Wireless Controller, Xbox Wireless Controller &amp; Mouse and Keyboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE PVP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3f5cee38c832ade3d66b0478109e69ef.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3f5cee38c832ade3d66b0478109e69ef.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/3f5cee38c832ade3d66b0478109e69ef.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with your friends, anywhere! Try out the Online PvP game mode and race to the finish line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOCAL PVP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/d5b9cc2c9a04f49d97ed6ffc7cec1144.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/d5b9cc2c9a04f49d97ed6ffc7cec1144.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/d5b9cc2c9a04f49d97ed6ffc7cec1144.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends to a fun, platforming race in our local splitscreen PvP Mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/f70378096b2300e29afa88425d3b9cba.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/f70378096b2300e29afa88425d3b9cba.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/f70378096b2300e29afa88425d3b9cba.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lokko Pizza</strong> is the best pizza joint in the world — and they hand-deliver smoking-hot pizzas anywhere on the globe. Run by Lokko and his brother, Chef Lokko, the shop has built its name on fresh dough, real ingredients, and an impossible promise: from a sweet Hawaiian Surprise to a cheesy Sicilian Special, your pizza arrives hot, fast, and right to your door — no matter where in the world you may be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But across town - <strong>Goobol</strong>, the CEO of a soulless fast-food empire, has built his fortune on cheap, frozen, factory-pressed pizza — and he can't stand competition. With an army of minions at his command, Goobol will do anything to shut Lokko down and force the world to eat his terrible pizzas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko isn't backing down. He'll run, drive, and even teleport through space and time to get a fresh, wholesome pizza into the hands of every hungry customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world deserves a better slice. Help Lokko deliver it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAM DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/51e8f5474f468c5b1c74aa504a49da6d.poster.avif?t=1785507146\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/51e8f5474f468c5b1c74aa504a49da6d.webm?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/51e8f5474f468c5b1c74aa504a49da6d.mp4?t=1785507146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lokko enables users of all ages to collaborate, create and play using Steam Deck™.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lokko enables users of all ages to collaborate, create and play using DualSense™ Wireless Controller, Xbox Wireless Controller &amp; Mouse and Keyboard.</p>", "short_description": "Lokko is a bouncy, action-packed 3D platformer where YOU create the adventure! In Lokko, players race to deliver hot pizzas around the globe while battling the sinister Goobol fast-food corporation.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/9fbd735ec2d2487a0d6b55270571a028fc36f0f6/header.jpg?t=1785507146", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/6c18c17fdffbd1dc265cfefb5ab03a213d7eed8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785507146", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/6c18c17fdffbd1dc265cfefb5ab03a213d7eed8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785507146", "website": "https://www.lokko.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 / AMD Radeon RX 5500 XT with 8GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<s